  "notes": "Cases, cases solved and persons arrested by type of offence, 2012–2013, read from the stored values of the yearbook tables; rows checked against the published totals. Other-agency Acts with fewer than 5 cases in any year merged into 'Other Acts'. '-' cells read as missing, so 'complete' is False where a solved or arrest count is a lower bound. Share and solved % computed by the author."
